{"actor": "agent:practice-coordinating", "at": "2026-11-26T03:59:57Z", "data": {"id": "STUDY-0001", "question": "Over the first full year of forward processing (2025-04-28 to 2026-04-27), does SWOT's reach water surface elevation at Baton Rouge rise and fall by the same amount as the gauge stage, to within five percent?", "request": {"file": "request.md", "sha": "8954f66e642777be5b1fd09ebeb403f8ff88f1ac3d30e14fd23923dc36665231"}}, "hash": "4302b9c74e7f5c4c395f27b0fd855ba8446e1d53e844e6e194006bd6ca383a0b", "kind": "study.started", "prev": "genesis", "seq": 0}
{"actor": "agent:practice-coordinating", "at": "2026-11-26T03:59:57Z", "data": {"change": "Third review round and its verification, the study tool and the procedure (procedure 0.7.0), in two rounds. First round: the lock binds every file a command names, read from the study directory, and everything Python could import beside them; the plan check requires the subject (pair), a dated window and four required criteria, and refuses unknown keys, a key given twice and more than one opening; a test case is two parts, the data and what was put in, and the method is given the data alone; the record of what has been opened is matched by log fingerprint; a verdict counts only after the finding, the signature names the finding by checksum, and the log check applies the locked rules to the run receipt again; the system trial's verdict is written to the study log; the lock binds the request and records the procedure's checksum; the scorecard check clean-opening is renamed no-failed-opening and lock-committed is added. Second round, after an independent verifier: every command in a plan is a launcher the tool knows ({python}, or uv run) followed by a script file that exists and is bound, and anything else is refused by the plan check; a rehearsal lists the files it needs under needs, which the tool looks for itself and the lock binds; commands and git run in an environment built from a short list of names, with further names only where a plan step lists them under passes_environment, and each run records the names it was given; power_to_refute_when_false can no longer be waived; the known-answer tests run the method in a process of its own that is given only the data, in shuffled batches, and keep what was put in, the seed and the scoring to themselves; the self-test check on an opening whose fetch exited 0 now exercises its guard, and four other checks that could pass for another reason were tightened.", "change_log": "change-log.jsonl", "problem_class": "the promise could be broken through what the study tool did not bind, check or record", "record_sha": "5cc12e36bdba7718d8efc01879d818a1571eb6721cda562fa8d1a4c7d586f8bb"}, "hash": "042cc62dd2e982f0d95ee4f2a28090826410949714b7e622273492e989cee954", "kind": "change.recorded", "prev": "4302b9c74e7f5c4c395f27b0fd855ba8446e1d53e844e6e194006bd6ca383a0b", "seq": 1}
